  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>洛托姆手機是一款適用於Cobblemon的Forge和Fabric模組。</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">洛托姆手機是一個實用的物品，讓你能夠隨時隨地使用電腦和治療功能，省去隨身攜帶的麻煩。它還自帶一個箱子來儲存物品，並且允許你使用生成檢查功能。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjJhcfl3JuCAxXmqpUCHbu9BccQ3ewLegQIBhAQ\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1127734171196981268/1207188862510571550/2024-02-14_01.49.05.png?ex=6631cbbd&amp;is=661f56bd&amp;hm=2cabc3fa520d7c34628f465e117f09384404cc914cfe397e12a496056b9790a0&amp;\" alt=\"洛托姆手機介面\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\" /></span></strong></span></p>\n<p id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjW_Km_xK6EAxUejpUCHZndBsQQ3ewLegQIBRAU\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\">安裝需求</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjW_Km_xK6EAxUejpUCHZndBsQQ3ewLegQIBRAU\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">洛托姆手機僅適用於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\">Cobblemon</a>。</span><strong><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\"><br /></span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\">洛托姆手機箱子</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjW_Km_xK6EAxUejpUCHZndBsQQ3ewLegQIBRAU\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">洛托姆手機箱子擁有63個儲存空間，其儲物功能與終界箱相同。</span><strong><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\"><br /></span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1127734171196981268/1207188863009824848/2024-02-14_01.49.41.png?ex=6622a27d&amp;is=662150fd&amp;hm=2e34c6c35f89a5abdc2759adf725e530ba6228ae44346754fd241afd22605641&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless&amp;width=1202&amp;height=676\" alt=\"箱子介面\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjW_Km_xK6EAxUejpUCHZndBsQQ3ewLegQIBRAU\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\">合成配方</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjW_Km_xK6EAxUejpUCHZndBsQQ3ewLegQIBRAU\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">你可以用6個銅錠、2個玻璃板和1顆鑽石來製作洛托姆手機。</span><strong><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\"><br /></span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong style=\"text-align: right; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1127734171196981268/1207188863886430258/2024-02-14_01.51.16.png?ex=6631cbbd&amp;is=661f56bd&amp;hm=3fb902113d9cc35f95f32daf4c26c4be3a56c5a91019a52cd3f9a2a15258a91a&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless&amp;width=1202&amp;height=676\" alt=\"洛托姆手機配方\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\" /></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>洛托姆手機生成檢查</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiSuIDYra6EAxX6lZUCHbqXAWoQ3ewLegQIARAU\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">洛托姆手機生成檢查功能讓你能查看所在生態域會出現哪些寶可夢，並顯示每隻寶可夢出現的百分比機率。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1127734171196981268/1207188863437508648/2024-02-14_01.50.01.png?ex=6631cbbd&amp;is=661f56bd&amp;hm=712b5fa7c398b064a3ae7ab6289bc5bdd9c601cbbce29cc28e9fe680fe26d064&amp;=&amp;format=webp&amp;quality=lossless&amp;width=1202&amp;height=676\" alt=\"生成檢查介面\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\" /></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>模組包</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjW_Km_xK6EAxUejpUCHZndBsQQ3ewLegQIBRAU\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">是的，你可以在你的模組包中使用這個模組。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjW_Km_xK6EAxUejpUCHZndBsQQ3ewLegQIBRAU\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\">贊助商</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"翻譯\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjW_Km_xK6EAxUejpUCHZndBsQQ3ewLegQIBRAU\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">本項目由BisectHosting贊助。如果你正在尋找伺服器，<a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/\">查看他們的主機方案</a>並在結帳時使用優惠碼<strong>Mur1lu</strong>，即可獲得首月25%的折扣！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1102457697040863307/1179546629150359663/1701296191235.jpg?ex=6632bf67&amp;is=66204a67&amp;hm=4af23d0a80006de3710f3649990ec8c7ac0ddfa232046627971826e6d4ea5774&amp;\" alt=\"BisectHosting-Mur1lu\" width=\"1903\" height=\"550\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>作者</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a title=\"MUR1LU\" href=\"https://twitter.com/mur1lu\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">MUR1LU</span></span></span></span></a></span></li>\n</ul>",
